     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "isInner": false,
     "settings": {
      "html": "<style>\n.enc-come{padding-top:0}\n.enc-passi{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}\n.enc-passo{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;min-width:0}\n.enc-passo-foto{aspect-ratio:4/5;margin-bottom:8px}\n.enc-passo .enc-h3{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:baseline}\n.enc-passo-n{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#6F7075;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.enc-passo .enc-p{font-size:16px;max-width:26em}\n@media (max-width:900px){.enc-passi{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px}.enc-passo-foto{aspect-ratio:3/2}}</style><div class=\"enc-c enc-sez enc-come\">\n<div class=\"enc-testa-sez\"><p class=\"enc-label\">How it works</p></div>\n<ol class=\"enc-passi\"><li class=\"enc-passo\">\n<figure class=\"enc-fig enc-passo-foto\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/step-handover-1400.webp\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/step-handover-800.webp 800w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/step-handover-1400.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 33vw\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1750\" alt=\"Folded wool and cashmere knitwear in warm neutral tones\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<h3 class=\"enc-t enc-h3\"><span class=\"enc-passo-n\">01</span>Hand over your waste.</h3>\n<p class=\"enc-p\">Unsold stock, returns and offcuts are collected. Infrared scanners identify each item's exact fibre in seconds.</p></li><li class=\"enc-passo\">\n<figure class=\"enc-fig enc-passo-foto\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/how-yarn-cones-1400.webp\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/how-yarn-cones-800.webp 800w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/how-yarn-cones-1400.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 33vw\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1750\" alt=\"Cones of recycled yarn by a mill window\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<h3 class=\"enc-t enc-h3\"><span class=\"enc-passo-n\">02</span>Matched and certified.</h3>\n<p class=\"enc-p\">Every batch goes to the partner best suited to its fibre. Each scan and handover is certified on blockchain.</p></li><li class=\"enc-passo\">\n<figure class=\"enc-fig enc-passo-foto\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/cta-wool-macro-1400.webp\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/cta-wool-macro-800.webp 800w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danielnistorr/danielnistorr/claude/benvegnu-sito/Encore-Sito/assets/web/cta-wool-macro-1400.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 33vw\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1750\" alt=\"Macro photograph of woven wool\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\n<h3 class=\"enc-t enc-h3\"><span class=\"enc-passo-n\">03</span>Ask, verify, buy back.</h3>\n<p class=\"enc-p\">Ask our AI anything about your fibre in plain language. Buy it back at a discount, certified.</p></li></ol>\n</div>"
     },
